<title>UK: RUGBY UNION - QUEENSLAND BEAT MIDLANDS 29-25.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION - QUEENSLAND BEAT MIDLANDS 29-25.</headline>
<dateline>STOURBRIDGE, England 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland (Australia) beat Midlands Counties 29-25 (halftime 21-15) in a rugby union tour match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
